   "t": "h2",
   "x": "Why DSU Online B.Com?"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "x": "The UGC-Entitled Dayananda Sagar University Online BCom (DSU Online BCom) is a 3-year online BCom degree programs designed for flexibility and career growth. Recognized among the best online BCom programs, this online BCom degree in India and BCom degree online offers students the skills to succeed in today’s dynamic business environment. The curriculum covers the fundamentals of commerce and includes popular specialisations such as supply chain management, fintech, and business analytics. Ideal for beginners or professionals looking to enhance their abilities, this online BCom course provides a structured learning experience with recorded content, live sessions, and professional mentoring. As one of the leading online BCom in India programs, including options for online BCom Bangalore, this online BCom degree allows you to learn at your own pace without compromising on quality or industry relevance. With DSU’s online BCom India program, students gain a respected degree that supports career advancement and prepares them for the future."
  },
